{"id":"b5a73a9da7e1ce01","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-baker-stark.md","title":"Baker–Stark Theorem","display":"thm-baker-stark — Baker–Stark Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-baker-stark","aliases":["58-thm-baker-stark"],"display":"thm-baker-stark — Baker–Stark Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-class-number]]","[[58-df-number-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-baker-stark"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-baker-stark</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-baker-stark — Baker–Stark Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"459e3bda75899406\" href=\"?note=459e3bda75899406\" title=\"58-df-class-number\">58-df-class-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92b2961f9d6bbcaa\" href=\"?note=92b2961f9d6bbcaa\" title=\"58-df-number-theory\">58-df-number-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(d,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baker\\text{-}stark} \\vdash \\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(d=a^2b\\to a=1)\\right]\\to\\left[\\left(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(1,\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d}))\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\{1,2,3,7,11,19,43,67,163\\}\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(2,\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d}))\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\{5,6,10,13,15,22,35,37,51,58,91,115,123,187,235,267,403,427\\}\\right)\\right]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baker\\text{-}stark} \\vdash \\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(d=a^2b\\to a=1)\\right]\\to\\left[\\left(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(1,\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d}))\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\{1,2,3,7,11,19,43,67,163\\}\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(2,\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d}))\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\{5,6,10,13,15,22,35,37,51,58,91,115,123,187,235,267,403,427\\}\\right)\\right]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The antecedent is the explicit positive-squarefree condition on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>; the displayed parameters are radicands in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d})\">\\(\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d})\\)</span>, not fundamental discriminants.</li>\n<li>The class-number-one classification is the Heegner–Baker–Stark theorem; the class-number-two list is written explicitly rather than hidden behind an undefined symbol.</li>\n<li>Complex multiplication (CM) curves: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>-invariant relates to class invariants.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-class-number","status":"resolved","id":"459e3bda75899406","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-number-theory","status":"resolved","id":"92b2961f9d6bbcaa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-number-theory]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baker\\text{-}stark} \\vdash \\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(d=a^2b\\to a=1)\\right]\\to\\left[\\left(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(1,\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d}))\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\{1,2,3,7,11,19,43,67,163\\}\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(2,\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d}))\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\{5,6,10,13,15,22,35,37,51,58,91,115,123,187,235,267,403,427\\}\\right)\\right]\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt{-d})","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false}],"bytes":1271,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4039","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-baker-stark.md|58-thm-baker-stark]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["459e3bda75899406","92b2961f9d6bbcaa"]}